## Model card

- **Name:** LongCat-2.5-Preview
- **Short description:** Meituan sparse mixture-of-experts frontier preview (~1.6T total / ~48B active) with 1M context and new native image understanding. Positioned for long-horizon agentic work across terminals, browsers, GUIs, spreadsheets, and design tools.
- **Provider / access:** Meituan LongCat API platform (OpenAI-compatible and Anthropic-compatible endpoints) and LongCat Chat; OpenCode catalogue lists a LongCat 2.5 Preview Free route (free for a limited time, zero retention). Chat Completions and Messages APIs.
- **Release / knowledge:** 2026-09-25 vendor changelog entry ("LongCat-2.5-Preview Now Available"); knowledge cutoff unknown — no verified cutoff found.
- **IDs:** `LongCat-2.5-Preview` (vendor API ID; OpenCode free-route Zen ID pattern not independently verified in fetched sources)
- **Context window:** 1,048,576 total (1M) with 131,072 max output per OpenCode catalogue metadata; vendor quick-start lists 1M context with 128K max output — verified via listings/docs only, not via capability measurement.
- **Modalities:** Text in/out; image in (native image understanding for cross-modal Q&A, summarisation, visual reasoning); reasoning toggle yes (`thinking` on/off with interleaved `reasoning_content` field); tool calls yes; no audio/video input or non-text output found.
- **Pricing (as of 2026-09-27):** Vendor pay-as-you-go $0.30 per 1M uncached input, $0.006 per 1M cached input, $1.20 per 1M output (listed as limited-time discounted rate); OpenCode free with no request cap for a limited window (end date unannounced); vendor promo of 5M tokens for previously verified users per community report.
- **Architecture:** Sparse MoE, ~1.6T total parameters with ~48B active per token, per vendor site metadata and Chinese trade coverage 2026-09-26; no technical report, model card, or weights published; not open-weights.

